      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saranac%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Saranac River courses through the southern and eastern parts of the town toward Lake Champlain.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
