      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saranac%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Saranac Hollow, a historic spot, sits close to the river within the town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
